usage: frozen_worker.py [-h] --output OUTPUT --run-root RUN_ROOT --condition
                        {B0,B1,B2,B3}
                        [--m2-global-anchor-interval M2_GLOBAL_ANCHOR_INTERVAL]
                        [--m2-global-drift-threshold M2_GLOBAL_DRIFT_THRESHOLD]
                        [--workload {planning,language}]
                        [--checkpoint CHECKPOINT] [--limit LIMIT]
                        [--warmup WARMUP]
                        [--questions-per-frame QUESTIONS_PER_FRAME]
                        [--question-offset QUESTION_OFFSET]
                        [--question-selection {ordered,balanced}]
                        [--sequence-file SEQUENCE_FILE]
                        [--capture-m1-controls] [--runtime-profile]
                        [--profile-frame PROFILE_FRAME] [--capture-m3-inputs]
                        [--trace-m3-decisions] [--m3-policy M3_POLICY]
                        [--repeat REPEAT]
                        [--measurement-set {main,attribution,efficiency,smoke}]
                        [--seed SEED] [--validate-only] [--execution-audit]
                        [--scene SCENE]
                        [--m3-strategy {native_full,exact_prefix,wsdr_kv}]
                        [--offline-wsgrr {A,B,C,D,NoM1Region,NoM1RegionMatched}]
                        [--m2-candidate-cost-table M2_CANDIDATE_COST_TABLE]
                        [--m2-cost-table M2_COST_TABLE]
                        [--m2-profile-evidence] [--m2-task-evidence]
                        [--m2-assessment-rules M2_ASSESSMENT_RULES]
                        [--m2-acceptance] [--window-budget WINDOW_BUDGET]
                        [--perception-only] [--window-targets WINDOW_TARGETS]
                        [--force-full-frame FORCE_FULL_FRAME]

One isolated condition; native model calls, unchanged sampling and admission.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --output OUTPUT
  --run-root RUN_ROOT
  --condition {B0,B1,B2,B3}
  --m2-global-anchor-interval M2_GLOBAL_ANCHOR_INTERVAL
                        Offline calibration override of the same M2 policy
  --m2-global-drift-threshold M2_GLOBAL_DRIFT_THRESHOLD
                        Offline calibration override of the same M2 policy
  --workload {planning,language}
  --checkpoint CHECKPOINT
  --limit LIMIT
  --warmup WARMUP
  --questions-per-frame QUESTIONS_PER_FRAME
  --question-offset QUESTION_OFFSET
                        Deterministic offset into the existing labelled
                        Conv/VQA questions; no answer-based filtering
  --question-selection {ordered,balanced}
  --sequence-file SEQUENCE_FILE
                        Explicit ordered real sample tokens for paired multi-
                        scene runs
  --capture-m1-controls
                        Save real committed inputs outside timed requests for
                        identical-state CPU controls
  --runtime-profile     Diagnostic only: sampled cProfile and CUDA trace, not
                        performance evidence
  --profile-frame PROFILE_FRAME
  --capture-m3-inputs   Capture real native inputs outside service timing for
                        offline calibration
  --trace-m3-decisions  Read-only candidate statistics for offline signal
                        replay; no embeddings or KV copies
  --m3-policy M3_POLICY
                        Unified fitted WSDR policy for this experiment
  --repeat REPEAT
  --measurement-set {main,attribution,efficiency,smoke}
  --seed SEED
  --validate-only
  --execution-audit     B3 only; one continuous scene, GPU stage profiling,
                        per-frame contract audit
  --scene SCENE         Scene token for --execution-audit; default first scene
  --m3-strategy {native_full,exact_prefix,wsdr_kv}
                        Explicit small M3 comparison with unchanged formal
                        M1/M2 and generation; no approvals
  --offline-wsgrr {A,B,C,D,NoM1Region,NoM1RegionMatched}
                        Explicit unapproved task experiment, B2 only
  --m2-candidate-cost-table M2_CANDIDATE_COST_TABLE
                        Offline D only: candidate cost identity, never a
                        production approval
  --m2-cost-table M2_COST_TABLE
                        Optional profiling metadata only; never affects M2
                        execution
  --m2-profile-evidence
                        Post-request M2 block/pipeline costs on the actual
                        source snapshot
  --m2-task-evidence    Record input-ID and generation witnesses for paired M2
                        quality evaluation
  --m2-assessment-rules M2_ASSESSMENT_RULES
                        Bind predeclared quality/error limits before model
                        execution
  --m2-acceptance       Require actual nonzero reuse through formal B3
                        admission
  --window-budget WINDOW_BUDGET
  --perception-only     Explicit official Detection/Map run with no language
                        questions; no feature counterfactual/audit scorer
                        (done in paired task runs)
  --window-targets WINDOW_TARGETS
                        D3 per_frame_metrics.jsonl; cardinalities only for the
                        explicit NoM1RegionMatched control
  --force-full-frame FORCE_FULL_FRAME
                        Explicit offline D counterfactual sample token; never
                        a production option
